The `documents` table contains hundreds of millions of rows. You want to add an index on `workspaceId` and `status`. The app uses Convex 1.41.0.

```ts
import { defineSchema, defineTable } from "convex/server";
import { v } from "convex/values";

const documents = defineTable({
  workspaceId: v.string(),
  status: v.string(),
  title: v.string(),
}).index("by_workspaceId", ["workspaceId"]);
```

